  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "RECOGNISE - How it usually looks",
      "sourcePage": 84,
      "sourceIndex": 2337
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "空后常是名词短语，题目不给任何提示词。",
      "sourcePage": 84,
      "sourceIndex": 2338
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TERM - What the term really means",
      "sourcePage": 84,
      "sourceIndex": 2339
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Article：a/an 表一个/某个；the 表特指或双方已",
      "sourcePage": 84,
      "sourceIndex": 2340
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "知；零冠词用于部分泛指/固定结构。",
      "sourcePage": 84,
      "sourceIndex": 2341
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "THINK - First sentence in your head: “先问这个名词是第一次说的一个，还是双方都知道的那个；还",
      "sourcePage": 84,
      "sourceIndex": 2342
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "要看固定结构。”",
      "sourcePage": 84,
      "sourceIndex": 2343
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "WHY - Why this works: 冠词题常结合语篇前后指代。",
      "sourcePage": 84,
      "sourceIndex": 2344
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STEPS - Follow this route",
      "sourcePage": 85,
      "sourceIndex": 2345
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1 确认空后是可数单数名词还是固定短语。",
      "sourcePage": 85,
      "sourceIndex": 2346
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2 第一次提到、非特指可数单数 → a/an。",
      "sourcePage": 85,
      "sourceIndex": 2347
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3 前文已提、唯一、被后置修饰明确限定 → the。",
      "sourcePage": 85,
      "sourceIndex": 2348
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4 检查固定搭配：in the morning, at school 等。",
      "sourcePage": 85,
      "sourceIndex": 2349
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5 a/an 看发音而不是字母。",
      "sourcePage": 85,
      "sourceIndex": 2350
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "✏ 草稿纸上具体写什么： 空格前后各画一条短线；标 pronoun? / contrast? / cause? / example?；两个",
      "sourcePage": 85,
      "sourceIndex": 2351
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "纠结选项写 A/B 再逐条验指代与逻辑。",
      "sourcePage": 85,
      "sourceIndex": 2352
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF/THEN - If... then...",
      "sourcePage": 85,
      "sourceIndex": 2353
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· an hour / a university",
      "sourcePage": 85,
      "sourceIndex": 2354
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· the same / the only / the first",
      "sourcePage": 85,
      "sourceIndex": 2355
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· go to school 与 go to the school 含义不同",
      "sourcePage": 85,
      "sourceIndex": 2356
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STOP - Stop when: 指代关系和固定用法都合理。",
      "sourcePage": 85,
      "sourceIndex": 2357
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STUCK - If you are stuck: 如果犹豫the，问：“读者现在是否知道我指哪一个？”",
      "sourcePage": 85,
      "sourceIndex": 2358
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "EXAMPLE - Worked example",
      "sourcePage": 85,
      "sourceIndex": 2359
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "I bought a book yesterday. ___ book is about space travel. 第二次提到同一本 → The。",
      "sourcePage": 85,
      "sourceIndex": 2360
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TRAPS - Common traps",
      "sourcePage": 85,
      "sourceIndex": 2361
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 看到单数名词就一定a。",
      "sourcePage": 85,
      "sourceIndex": 2362
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 按首字母而不是发音选a/an。",
      "sourcePage": 85,
      "sourceIndex": 2363
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "CHECK - Final check",
      "sourcePage": 85,
      "sourceIndex": 2364
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 第一次还是已知？",
      "sourcePage": 85,
      "sourceIndex": 2365
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 固定结构？",
      "sourcePage": 85,
      "sourceIndex": 2366
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 发音？",
      "sourcePage": 85,
      "sourceIndex": 2367
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "🔧 纠错动作： 做完不要只对答案，先给错误归类。错误代码： 7-P 代词指代｜7-L 逻辑关系｜7-T 主题链",
      "sourcePage": 85,
      "sourceIndex": 2368
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "｜7-O 位置不合理｜7-R 内容重复。",
      "sourcePage": 85,
      "sourceIndex": 2369
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "同一种错误连续出现2次 → 在对应代码旁画★，下次做题先检查这一项。",
      "sourcePage": 85,
      "sourceIndex": 2370
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "MEMORY - 30-second memory: 冠词问：一个新的，还是那个已知的。",
      "sourcePage": 85,
      "sourceIndex": 2371
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "可选巩固｜5题（查完SOP后再做）",
      "sourcePage": 86,
      "sourceIndex": 2373
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1. 第一次提到一只狗：___ dog",
      "sourcePage": 86,
      "sourceIndex": 2374
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. 再次提到同一只狗：___ dog",
      "sourcePage": 86,
      "sourceIndex": 2375
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. ___ hour",
      "sourcePage": 86,
      "sourceIndex": 2376
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4. ___ university",
      "sourcePage": 86,
      "sourceIndex": 2377
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. 冠词a/an看字母还是发音？",
      "sourcePage": 86,
      "sourceIndex": 2378
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "答案速查：1. a；2. the；3. an；4. a；5. 发音。",
      "sourcePage": 86,
      "sourceIndex": 2379
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "— GF7 本题型到这里。下次卡住直接 Ctrl+F 搜“GF7”或题型关键词。—",
